abstract: "Data processing scripts and R workflows to reproduce the terrestrial analyses, Fig. 1, reported in the article 'Identifying Conservation Gaps: A Framework for Evaluating National Contributions to the 30x30 Target' and  Table S2 in the supplementary material for."
